text = "   This is a game about grappling    
   to the top of the level by left   
   clicking on floating blocks in    
   the given level. The goal is to   
  make it to the highest block, and  
  make it all the way back down to   
   the flat plane that you started   
 on. Try to complete levels as fast  
as you can, beating your high scores."
